    "description": "**Problem:** The Account object has four record types (two person accounts, two non-person). \"Recently Viewed\" does not show which type a record is, so reps cannot tell them apart.\n\n**Requirement:** Update the Account search layout so Recently Viewed shows:\n\n* Account name (partner name, player name or referral name, depending on record type)\n* Record type\n* A status value. There may be no single status field across all four record types. Consider a formula field that combines status by record type.\n* Created date or modified date, to help ranking.\n\n**Note:** Accounts will not use the same columns as Signups. Discuss further before picking this up.\n\n**Acceptance criteria:** To be confirmed before pickup.\n\n**Source:** Wagertech Internal Sync, Sep 29, 2026.",
